    "notes": "Inspected all 12 views. Small wall-hung spice shelf with a shaped back, hanging hole, two curved shelves and a lower bin. Distressed red paint over bare wood is consistent on front, back and sides. Top and bottom views confirm real board thickness throughout. Only 524 triangles.",
